&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;　株主名簿管理人&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 441px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 6px"&gt;－&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 26.67px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 196.2px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;　取次所&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 441px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 6px"&gt;－&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 26.67px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 196.2px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;　買取手数料&lt;/p&gt;
